{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03121",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 4.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.4,
      "end_seconds": 10.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Right, no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.02,
      "end_seconds": 17.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.59,
      "end_seconds": 22.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 22.93,
      "end_seconds": 25.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "we came because of a limp"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.94,
      "end_seconds": 30.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.33,
      "end_seconds": 35.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "for about a week, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.38,
      "end_seconds": 43.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.13,
      "end_seconds": 46.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "I'd call it severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.55,
      "end_seconds": 49.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.3,
      "end_seconds": 57.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "It settles a little with a stick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.35,
      "end_seconds": 60.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.82,
      "end_seconds": 69.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "yeah, when it starts I tend to get stiffness putting on socks as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.75,
      "end_seconds": 77.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.09,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 77.94,
      "end_seconds": 85.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Mm, tell the doctor about the the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.79,
      "end_seconds": 89.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.35,
      "end_seconds": 95.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.78,
      "end_seconds": 107.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "As for stiffness putting on socks, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.79,
      "end_seconds": 111.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.01,
      "end_seconds": 120.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.1,
      "end_seconds": 128.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "So, take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.13,
      "end_seconds": 137.29,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "I'd call it severe. There was night pain, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.85,
      "end_seconds": 142.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.64,
      "end_seconds": 154.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.04,
      "end_seconds": 173.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 81, temperature 36.5. And pressure 111 over 81, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.92,
      "end_seconds": 179.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.49,
      "end_seconds": 182.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.24,
      "end_seconds": 206.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Hip rotation is painful and limited and you have a limp favouring the right side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.97,
      "end_seconds": 213.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "all finished, thank you. Any numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.01,
      "end_seconds": 216.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "not at all, no numbness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.08,
      "end_seconds": 222.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "any weight loss, fall or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.89,
      "end_seconds": 227.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, fall or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.54,
      "end_seconds": 230.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.47,
      "end_seconds": 234.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.08,
      "end_seconds": 242.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Right, do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.48,
      "end_seconds": 247.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Well, uh, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.02,
      "end_seconds": 252.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 253.78,
      "end_seconds": 273.4,
      "duration_seconds": 19.62,
      "text": "She is on paracetamol, 650 milligrams, when needed for the knee pain, I give it to her. Uh, it's levetiracetam, 500 milligrams, twice a day, doctor. Yeah, it's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.51,
      "end_seconds": 279.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "So, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.53,
      "end_seconds": 289.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "I've had arthritis in my knees for nearly five years now. I've had epilepsy, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.06,
      "end_seconds": 291.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.46,
      "end_seconds": 302.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.27,
      "text": "I have COPD, for nearly five years. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.37,
      "end_seconds": 313.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "Right, so arthritis in your knees and COPD are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.83,
      "end_seconds": 320.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.99,
      "end_seconds": 324.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.7,
      "end_seconds": 331.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.25,
      "end_seconds": 351.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I'd lean towards hip osteoarthritis. It could also be a back problem, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.86,
      "end_seconds": 360.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.42,
      "end_seconds": 368.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like hip osteoarthritis, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.88,
      "end_seconds": 408.39,
      "duration_seconds": 28.51,
      "text": "I think an X-ray of the hips makes sense here, for hip pain. For this, naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day with food, two weeks. You take it by mouth. It's for hip pain. Use a walking stick in the left hand and do gentle strengthening exercises. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.73,
      "end_seconds": 412.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Erm, thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.21,
      "end_seconds": 419.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "book a review in six weeks that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 420.91,
      "end_seconds": 425.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Oh, uh, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.13,
      "end_seconds": 433.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
}